data-astro-cid-g6aukup3></polygon> </svg> <div class="inner maf-hero-inner" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3> <span class="section-label" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>Monthly Sessions · Online</span> <h1 class="maf-h1" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>Enterprise AI leaders, solving the same problems — together.</h1> <p class="maf-sub" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>Join 50–100 enterprise AI leaders in monthly, closed-door sessions you can&#39;t find anywhere else. An invited leader talk and candid Q&amp;A under Chatham House rules, then hands-on unconference breakouts on the problems you bring.</p> <ul class="maf-value" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3> <li data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>Fellow technology leaders</li><li data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>Real case studies</li><li data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>A peer circle that actually helps</li> </ul> <div class="maf-hero-cta" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3> <a href="https://events.itrevolution.com/monthly-ai-forum/register/" class="btn-gold maf-btn" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>Reserve your seats</a> <a href="#sessions" class="maf-btn-outline" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>See upcoming sessions</a> </div> <p class="maf-hero-note" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>Per seat, billed yearly</p> </div> </header>  <section class="maf-problem" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3> <div class="inner inner--narrow" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3> <span class="section-label section-label--paper" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>The problem</span> <h2 class="maf-h2 maf-h2--paper" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>Every AI leader is solving the same problems — in isolation.</h2> <p class="maf-problem-body" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>The AI landscape is moving at breakneck pace, but the chances to compare notes are rare — so leaders spend months solving the same challenges alone, reinventing what a peer may have already figured out.</p> <ul class="maf-problem-list" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3> <li data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>How do we elevate developer productivity with AI — and how do we actually measure it?</li><li data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>As leaders and non-developers vibe-code apps into production, who will manage them?</li><li data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>AI-assisted coding is reshaping development team structures — which ones deliver more value, faster?</li> </ul> <p class="maf-problem-close" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>Someone in your peer group is figuring out parts of the answer right now.</p> </div> </section>  <section class="maf-format" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3> <div class="maf-format-facet" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3> <svg viewBox="0 0 1440 460" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3> <polygon points="0,0 300,0 200,150 0,210" fill="#8BC5A4" opacity="0.10" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3></polygon> <polygon points="300,0 620,0 520,130 200,150" fill="#0d4d59" opacity="0.55" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3></polygon> <polygon points="1440,120 1120,90 1160,320 1440,360" fill="#99B8A1" opacity="0.08" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3></polygon> </svg> </div> <div class="inner maf-format-inner" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3> <span class="section-label" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>The solution · how each session works</span> <h2 class="maf-h2" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>Two hours, once a month</h2> <p class="maf-format-meta" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>Live online · 10:00am–12:00pm PT (rotates for timezones)</p> <div class="maf-format-grid" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3> <div class="maf-block" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3> <span class="maf-block-tag" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>Hour 1 · Learn</span> <p class="maf-block-title" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>Invited leader talk + candid Q&amp;A</p> <p class="maf-block-body" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>A 20-minute experience report from a technology leader, then 40 minutes of off-the-record Q&amp;A under Chatham House rules. Candid stories, nothing recorded.</p> </div> <div class="maf-block" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3> <span class="maf-block-tag" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>Hour 2 · Work</span> <p class="maf-block-title" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>Unconference breakouts</p> <p class="maf-block-body" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>Self-organize with fellow travelers on the real problems attendees pitched in advance — worked alongside peers who may have already solved them.</p> </div> </div> </div> </section>  <section class="maf-model" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3> <div class="inner" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3> <span class="section-label section-label--paper" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>The unconference model</span> <h2 class="maf-h2 maf-h2--paper" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>Bring the problems keeping you up at night</h2> <ol class="maf-steps" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3> <li data-astro-cid-g6aukup3> <span class="maf-step-num" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>Before</span> <p class="maf-step-body" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>Submit your hardest problems. We publish them so you come prepared.</p> </li> <li data-astro-cid-g6aukup3> <span class="maf-step-num" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>During</span> <p class="maf-step-body" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>Join the group tackling what matters most to you and work it with peers facing the same challenge.</p> </li> <li data-astro-cid-g6aukup3> <span class="maf-step-num" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>After</span> <p class="maf-step-body" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>Groups document what they discover and present findings back to the community.</p> </li> </ol> <p class="maf-model-provenance" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>For the past ten years, ETLS Forum cohorts have used this exact model to produce position papers, guidance documents, experiments, videos, and case studies (<a href="https://itrevolution.com/resources/">browse them here</a>). The Monthly AI Forum scales it — monthly. Maybe you'll build the next one.</p> </div> </section>  <section id="sessions" class="maf-sessions" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3> <div class="inner" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3> <span class="section-label" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>This term · July → September 2026</span> <h2 class="maf-h2" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>Upcoming sessions</h2> <div class="maf-session-grid" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3> <div class="maf-session-card" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3> <div class="maf-session-avatar" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3> <span class="maf-mono" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>DW</span> <img src="/images/speakers/forum/dustin-warner.jpg" alt="Dustin Warner" class="maf-avatar-img" loading="lazy" onerror="this.remove()" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3> </div> <span class="maf-session-date" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>Wed, Jul 15, 2026</span> <p class="maf-session-speaker" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>Dustin Warner</p> <p class="maf-session-role" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>Director of Software Engineering, NRC Health</p> </div><div class="maf-session-card" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3> <div class="maf-session-avatar" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3> <span class="maf-mono" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>JS</span> <img src="/images/speakers/forum/jess-szmajda.jpg" alt="Jess Szmajda" class="maf-avatar-img" loading="lazy" onerror="this.remove()" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3> </div> <span class="maf-session-date" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>Wed, Aug 12, 2026</span> <p class="maf-session-speaker" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>Jess Szmajda</p> <p class="maf-session-role" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>VP, One Pipeline, Capital One</p> </div><div class="maf-session-card" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3> <div class="maf-session-avatar" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3> <span class="maf-mono" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>MW</span> <img src="/images/speakers/forum/michael-winslow.jpg" alt="Michael Winslow" class="maf-avatar-img" loading="lazy" onerror="this.remove()" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3> </div> <span class="maf-session-date" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>Wed, Sept 9, 2026</span> <p class="maf-session-speaker" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>Michael Winslow</p> <p class="maf-session-role" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>Vice President of Engineering, Platform &amp; SRE, Thrive Market</p> </div> </div> </div> </section>  <section class="maf-who" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3> <div class="inner inner--narrow" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3> <span class="section-label section-label--paper" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>Who it&#39;s for</span> <h2 class="maf-h2 maf-h2--paper" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>Built for ETLS leaders — and their rising stars.</h2> <p class="maf-who-body" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>Designed for the technology leaders who attended the Enterprise Tech Leadership Summit in 2024 or 2025 — and the rising stars you want to bring along. It&#39;s for leaders who want to build a trusted network of fellow travelers, contribute back to it, and apply what they learn in their own context.</p> <div class="maf-loop" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3> <span class="maf-loop-label" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>The practice loop</span> <div class="maf-loop-steps" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3> <span class="maf-loop-step" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>Listen<span class="maf-loop-arrow" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>→</span></span><span class="maf-loop-step" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>Reflect<span class="maf-loop-arrow" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>→</span></span><span class="maf-loop-step" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>Practice<span class="maf-loop-arrow" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>→</span></span><span class="maf-loop-step" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>Report back</span> </div> <p class="maf-loop-note" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>This isn&#39;t passive content consumption.</p> </div> </div> </section>  <section class="maf-included" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3> <div class="inner inner--narrow" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3> <span class="section-label" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>What&#39;s included</span> <h2 class="maf-h2" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>A membership, not a webinar</h2> <ul class="maf-included-list" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3> <li data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>Three live monthly sessions</li><li data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>A 20-minute invited leader talk + 40-minute candid Q&amp;A under Chatham House rules</li><li data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>Hands-on unconference breakouts on the problems you pitch in advance</li><li data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>Member-only analyst summaries and a growing artifact library</li><li data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>Gene Kim–authored session summaries to bring learnings back to your team</li><li data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>Access to project cohorts and peer circles that keep working between sessions</li> </ul> </div> </section>  <section class="maf-pricing" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3> <div class="inner" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3> <span class="section-label section-label--paper" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>Membership &amp; pricing</span> <h2 class="maf-h2 maf-h2--paper" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>Per seat, billed yearly</h2> <div class="maf-tier-grid" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3> <div class="maf-tier" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>  <p class="maf-tier-name" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>Individual Seat</p> <p class="maf-tier-price" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>$5,000<span class="maf-tier-per" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>per seat / per year</span></p> <p class="maf-tier-note" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>Solo leaders, or your company&#39;s first seat.</p> </div><div class="maf-tier" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>  <p class="maf-tier-name" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>Team of 2–4</p> <p class="maf-tier-price" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>$3,000<span class="maf-tier-per" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>per seat / per year</span></p> <p class="maf-tier-note" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>Bring your rising stars.</p> </div><div class="maf-tier" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>  <p class="maf-tier-name" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>Team of 5+</p> <p class="maf-tier-price" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>$2,000<span class="maf-tier-per" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>per seat / per year</span></p> <p class="maf-tier-note" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>Scale it across your organization.</p> </div> </div> <p class="maf-tier-reserve" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3><a href="https://events.itrevolution.com/monthly-ai-forum/register/" class="btn-gold maf-btn" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>Reserve</a></p>  <p class="maf-pricing-foot" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>Already a member? <a href="https://billing.stripe.com/p/login/dRm28sbb17pt5kEeE7awo00">Manage your membership</a> — update your card, download invoices, or cancel. Annual billing standard; quarterly invoicing on request — and you can split it across budget codes. <a href="mailto:events@itrevolution.com">Email us</a>.</p> </div> </section>  <section class="maf-budget" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3> <div class="maf-format-facet" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3> <svg viewBox="0 0 1440 460" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3> <polygon points="0,0 300,0 200,150 0,210" fill="#8BC5A4" opacity="0.10" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3></polygon> <polygon points="1440,120 1120,90 1160,320 1440,360" fill="#99B8A1" opacity="0.08" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3></polygon> </svg> </div> <div class="inner maf-budget-inner" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3> <span class="section-label" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>Justify the investment</span> <h2 class="maf-h2" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>Easy to expense. Hard to beat on value.</h2> <p class="maf-budget-lead" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>$5,000/year for 11 sessions works out to about $455 a session — versus a single day at Gartner Symposium (~$4,000) or one executive-coaching session ($3,000–$5,000). Instead of sending one more person to a generic annual conference, invest in 11 months of working sessions with leaders solving your exact problems. In this environment, none of us can wait a year for these insights.</p> <p class="maf-budget-sub" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>Budget codes this typically gets approved under:</p> <ul class="maf-budget-codes" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3> <li data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>Conferences &amp; Events</li><li data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>Executive Education / Leadership Development</li><li data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>AI Program / Innovation Budget</li> </ul> <p class="maf-budget-note" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>Annual billing standard; quarterly invoicing available on request. Can split across budget codes (e.g., Conference + L&amp;D).</p> </div> </section>  <section class="maf-quotes" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3> <div class="inner" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3> <span class="section-label section-label--paper" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>In their words</span> <div class="maf-quote-grid" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3> <figure class="maf-quote" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>  <blockquote data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>&quot;By far the best place to get industry leaders into a small room to talk about the important changes in AI and how it affects us. We share knowledge, understand the problem space, and execute.&quot;</blockquote> <figcaption data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>— Forum member</figcaption> </figure><figure class="maf-quote" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>  <blockquote data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>&quot;This isn&#39;t an AI enthusiasm group. It&#39;s a leadership forum for people dealing with the real consequences of AI at scale — flow, constraints, and ownership. Unusually practical.&quot;</blockquote> <figcaption data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>— Forum member</figcaption> </figure><figure class="maf-quote" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>  <blockquote data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>&quot;I want my rising leaders to meet people outside the company, find mentors, and import important ideas so they can solve ever-larger problems.&quot;</blockquote> <figcaption data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>— Sarah Miller, Senior Technical Fellow, Collins Aerospace</figcaption> </figure> </div> </div> </section>  <section class="maf-rules" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3> <div class="inner inner--narrow maf-rules-inner" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3> <span class="section-label" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>House rules</span> <p class="maf-rules-body" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>Closed-door, Chatham House: share learnings, not secrets. We produce anonymized summaries for members only. These are the same rules that have run the ETLS Forum for a decade — and the NYC and SF CTO Clubs.</p> </div> </section>  <section class="maf-final" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3> <div class="inner inner--narrow maf-final-inner" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3> <h2 class="maf-final-h2" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>Reserve your seats for this term.</h2> <p class="maf-final-body" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>Three sessions with the enterprise AI leaders solving the problems you&#39;re solving.</p> <a href="https://events.itrevolution.com/monthly-ai-forum/register/" class="btn-gold maf-btn" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>Reserve your seats</a> <p class="maf-final-note" data-astro-cid-g6aukup3>Questions? Email <a href="mailto:genek@itrevolution.com">Gene Kim</a> or <a href="mailto:marjorie@itrevolution.com">Marjorie Kessler</a>. Already a member? <a href="https://billing.stripe.com/p/login/dRm28sbb17pt5kEeE7awo00">Manage your membership</a> — update your card, download invoices, or cancel.</p> </div> </section> <footer class="site-footer" role="contentinfo" data-astro-cid-sz7xmlte> <div class="footer-inner" data-astro-cid-sz7xmlte> <div class="footer-brand" data-astro-cid-sz7xmlte> <img class="footer-wordmark" src="/images/it-rev-logo-white.svg" alt="IT Revolution" width="125" height="30" data-astro-cid-sz7xmlte> <p class="footer-tagline" data-astro-cid-sz7xmlte>Where technology leaders learn from each other — home of the Enterprise Technology Leadership Summit and the Enterprise AI Summit.</p> </div> <ul class="footer-social" aria-label="IT Revolution on social media" data-astro-cid-sz7xmlte> <li data-astro-cid-sz7xmlte> <a class="social-btn" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/itrevolution/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="LinkedIn" data-astro-cid-sz7xmlte> <span class="social-icon social-icon--linkedin" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-sz7xmlte></span> </a> </li><li data-astro-cid-sz7xmlte> <a class="social-btn" href="https://www.facebook.com/itrevolutionofficial/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Facebook" data-astro-cid-sz7xmlte> <span class="social-icon social-icon--facebook" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-sz7xmlte></span> </a> </li><li data-astro-cid-sz7xmlte> <a class="social-btn" href="https://x.com/ITRevBooks" target="_blank" rel="n